<title>UK: Pillar Property buys UK retail parks.</title>
<headline>Pillar Property buys UK retail parks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Pillar Property Investments Plc said on Monday it bought CW Harris Properties Ltd for 15.58 million stg, including 12.38 million stg in cash and 3.2 million stg in stock.</p>
<p>Harris owns five fully-let retail parks consisting of 350,000 square feet of warehouse space.</p>
<p>The acquisition will bring Pillar's total number of retail parks to 20. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
